{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/17eab09980fb06832638dcaed492befa.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1232 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Gatekeeper</strong> is a combat strategy game that combines light roguelike elements with side-scrolling action.<br>You will travel to villages to defend them. As the final line of defense, each time you arrive at a new village, you will start from scratch: cultivate combat units, obtain mechanisms, build your lineup, and then enter the dungeon to guard it, preventing monsters from pouring out...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>Each village\u2019s battles start from zero. Each run lasts around 7 in-game days, with different stages each day. Players must deploy mechanisms and combat units according to the stage conditions to defend today\u2019s dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/282a1b1ebec99b76885329904920331a.poster.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1160 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/282a1b1ebec99b76885329904920331a.webm?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/282a1b1ebec99b76885329904920331a.mp4?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/95325c7ec05e9f0631efc2e3a5204e26.poster.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1160 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/95325c7ec05e9f0631efc2e3a5204e26.webm?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/95325c7ec05e9f0631efc2e3a5204e26.mp4?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchasing Equipment and Items</strong><br>The town\u2019s guild has a shop where players can buy various equipment to enhance their combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/147c3cbbfd3567021cdde62d4bc50512.poster.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1160 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/147c3cbbfd3567021cdde62d4bc50512.webm?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/147c3cbbfd3567021cdde62d4bc50512.mp4?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiring Deployment Units</strong><br>Deployment units can also be hired. Recruit units according to your needs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/5a7c218d907688c136444e6f779ec8d7.poster.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1160 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/5a7c218d907688c136444e6f779ec8d7.webm?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/5a7c218d907688c136444e6f779ec8d7.mp4?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Deployment Units</strong><br>Hired units also need to be strengthened. Players can use gold to upgrade units. Reasonable gold usage and experienced training are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/6571a2f7bdb536d68eabbeb454e1f5a4.poster.avif?t=1772027115\" width=1160 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/6571a2f7bdb536d68eabbeb454e1f5a4.webm?t=1772027115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the dungeon mechanisms and defend the dungeon entrance.<br>In this real-time strategic tower defense game filled with challenge, recruit unique combat units, use items, collect equipment, and build your own defense line to resist the terrifying waves of enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619780?t=1772027115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619780?t=1772027115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/c75cd957cdfab07da4c86a7e7a84982e70ebcb39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772027115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/c75cd957cdfab07da4c86a7e7a84982e70ebcb39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772027115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3664420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\